{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/semirings\/countingsemiring"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CountingSemiring","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sj","text":"Numeric","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"With unit weights, ","type":"text"},{"code":"dagShortestDistances","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" counts the paths. With other weights it sums, over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every path, the product of the path’s weights, which is the probability semiring when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"weights are probabilities.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"zero"},{"text":" is 0, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"one"},{"text":" is 1, ⊕ is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"+"},{"text":" and ⊗ is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*"},{"text":". It is not selective, because ⊕ is not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"idempotent (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"a ⊕ a == 2a"},{"text":"), and not ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Comparable"},{"text":", so only ","type":"text"},{"type":"code